  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "standard",
    "description": "tonyd2wild's DeepSeek V4 Flash DSpark profile on two Sparks: vLLM tensor parallel 2 with the bundled DSpark drafter (k=5), a 4-bit nvfp4_ds_mla KV cache, B12X MoE and a 1,048,576-token context, on bjk110's DSpark vLLM runtime image (digest-pinned) with upstream's overlay (scheduler cold-prefill garble fix, draft shared-expert loader fix) and NVFP4 stage patches applied at build, plus upstream's native-vision port (ViT and aligner, image input). Model: Vision-Exp checkpoint at 6821d6ad (upstream pins 86f746b3, which differs only by two documentation files). Same-creator alternatives for this model and Spark count are older tonyd2wild repositories (preview-checkpoint DSpark, Ray-free MTP recipes); other creators' choices are separate recipes. Licences (information only): recipe MIT, model MIT, overlay files derived from vLLM (Apache-2.0). Upstream figures (about 55 tok/s mean, 78 peak on text 0731; about 53 tok/s real-prompt decode on Vision-Exp) are claims until measured here; Vonk physical two-Spark acceptance is pending. Upstream warns that speculative buffers allocate on the first real request, so a memory utilization above 0.78 can boot and then fail under traffic.",
    "tags": [
      "deepseek",
      "distributed",
      "dspark",
      "nvfp4-kv",
      "reasoning",
      "spark",
